            "review_title": "Review at Phở Thìn Hồ Nghinh",
            "review_text": "Алина\nSochi, Russia178 contributions\n0\nBest Pho Bo\nSep 2026 • Couples\nI don't understand at all why this place has a rating of 4.3. We have been living in Da Nang for a month and Pho Bo has tried many places, but I assure you - this is the most delicious for me.\n\nI like the broth the most. It's really rich, tasty, not bland at all. And the beef here is just a separate story.\n\nI haven't eaten meat for 11 years. Completely. But at some point, she decided that she had to get some iron somehow, and tried beef here. And I was absolutely delighted) I really didn't expect to like it so much. It is soft, delicious, and absolutely perfect with this broth.\n\nIn the end, now if you want Pho Bo, we only go here. I don't even particularly want to look for other places anymore) For me, this is the best Pho Bo in Da Nang so far.\n\n—\n\nI really don't understand why this restaurant only got 4.3 stars. We have lived in Da Nang for a month and have eaten beef pho in quite a few places, but I can say for sure that this is the best.\n\nWhat I like the most is the broth. The water is very rich, fragrant, and has a distinct flavor, not bland at all. As for beef, that's a whole other story.\n\nI haven't eaten meat for 11 years. Do not eat at all. But sometimes I thought I needed to supplement iron somehow, so I decided to try the beef here. And I was really surprised because it was so delicious) The meat is tender, tasty, and it goes perfectly with the broth.\n\nFinally, now whenever we want to eat beef pho, we just come here. I don't even want to look for another place) For me, this is the best beef pho in Da Nang right now.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 12, 2026",
