            "review_text": "misskroft\nMoscow, Russia759 contributions\n0\nUpset by lack of soybean sprouts\nJul 2026 • Couples\nIn Nha Trang, it's our favorite noodle shop, so in Da Nang they came here with huge expectations and plans to eat every day. Unfortunately, reality has disappointed. For some reason, this branch doesn't give soybean sprouts to soup. It would seem small, but without them the taste of the broth is completely different and the noodles lose all their charm. Too bad, without the greenery, it's not the same legendary pho.\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten July 28, 2026",
